  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect API version 4.0 provides resources that enable you to automate actions you take in App Store Connect.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "New Features",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Use the new `webhooks` endpoints to setup and configure notifications for events that happen with your apps, including App version state events and TestFlight feedback events. For more information about webhook notifications, see `webhook-notifications`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/webhook-notifications"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `accessibility-declarations` resources are now available to automate creating, updating, and reading accessibility declarations for your app per device family. You can also now use `PATCH-v1-apps-_id_` to update the `accessibilityURL` for your app. For more information about accessibility declarations, see `configuring-accessibility-declarations`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/accessibility-declarations",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-apps-_id_",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/configuring-accessibility-declarations"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Get TestFlight feedback screenshots and crash logs from beta testers for your apps. For more information about beta-tester feedback, see `beta-feedback-crash-submissions` and `beta-feedback-screenshot-submissions`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/beta-feedback-crash-submissions",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/beta-feedback-screenshot-submissions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can now read the customer review summary for your apps by using `GET-v1-apps-_id_-customerReviewSummarizations`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-apps-_id_-customerReviewSummarizations"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can now manage background assets for your app that you can upload and download separately from the Apple hosted app. For more information about these assets, see `managing-apple-hosted-background-assets`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/managing-apple-hosted-background-assets"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Activities for Game Center resources are now available; for more information, see `game-center-activities`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/game-center-activities"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can now setup and configure Game Center challenges. For more information on these challenges, see `game-center-challenges`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/game-center-challenges"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Improvements",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "XcodeMetrics now includes `recommendedMetricGoal`. Use `GET-v1-apps-_id_-perfPowerMetrics` to view the available recommendations for your app metrics.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-apps-_id_-perfPowerMetrics"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There are new enums available for `mapAction` when creating or modifying an App Clip advanced experience. To learn more, see `Place-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppClipAdvancedExperience/Attributes-data.dictionary/Place-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "`uploading-assets-to-app-store-connect` now shows all media types that support upload to App Store Connect API.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/uploading-assets-to-app-store-connect"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `streamlinedPurchasingEnabled` has a default value of `true` for the object `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/App/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `APPLE_VISION_PRO` is now documented for `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/Device/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Deprecations",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The attribute `challengeEnabled` is now deprecated from `POST-v1-gameCenterDetails` and `PATCH-v1-gameCenterDetails-_id_`. Use `challenges` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-gameCenterDetails",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-gameCenterDetails-_id_"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "`POST-v1-gameCenterLeaderboardSetMemberLocalizations` and `PATCH-v1-gameCenterLeaderboardSetMemberLocalizations-_id_` are deprecated.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-gameCenterLeaderboardSetMemberLocalizations",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-gameCenterLeaderboardSetMemberLocalizations-_id_"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Removals",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Create an App Store version submission is now removed. Use `POST-v1-reviewSubmissions` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-reviewSubmissions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `gamblingAndContests` and `seventeenPlus` properties are now removed from `GET-v1-appInfos-_id_-ageRatingDeclaration` and `PATCH-v1-ageRatingDeclarations-_id_`. Use the `contests` or `gambling` properties instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-appInfos-_id_-ageRatingDeclaration",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-ageRatingDeclarations-_id_"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
